# Code Intelligence Agent — EXA Pipeline Governance

## Overview

The Code Intelligence Agent (`code_intelligence_agent.py`) is the 7th domain agent (domain: `coding`). It autonomously learns code patterns from RSS feeds, GitHub trending, StackOverflow, and internet research, then crystallizes actionable knowledge as TENSION crystals. Every resolved TENSION becomes a future LOCKED recall — the critical multiplier loop.

## Architecture

```
CodeIntelligenceAgent (2h cycle)
├── observe() — RSS, StackOverflow API, SecureSearchProxy for gap research
├── recall()  — dedup against existing code crystals via content_hash
├── reason()  — sovereign 14B inference (qwen2.5-coder, zero cost)
├── propose() — innovation proposals for high-confidence patterns
└── crystallize() — TENSION crystals → PG + Vectorize (nate-code-search) + R2

BulkCrystalIngestion (admin-triggered, 4 levers)
├── Lever 1: Codebase Bulk Scan     — local repo → per-file architecture patterns
├── Lever 2: GitHub Trending        — top repos → README + structure distillation
├── Lever 3: StackOverflow Dump     — top-voted answers → battle-tested solutions
└── Lever 4: Synthesis Acceleration — 4x crystallizer burst for rapid clustering
```

