## Vectorize Index

Code crystals are indexed in `nate-code-search` (Cloudflare Vectorize, BGE-large-en-v1.5 embeddings). The `_DOMAIN_INDEX_MAP` routes coding queries to `["wisdom", "conversation", "code"]`.

## ODPE Context Budget

Coding TENSION queries receive `CONTEXT_TOKENS_TENSION_CODING = 1200` tokens (vs 700 for general TENSION), ensuring the sovereign 14B has enough context for complex code analysis.

